Twilio offers both telephony and messaging functionalities using a single platform that supports phone number masking, two-way private SMS, and reliable delivery. It is highly scalable and widely used for such privacy-focused messaging apps. The Twilio SMS API complements the main telephony API, making Twilio the most comprehensive and suitable option for building TextSlide’s functionalities.
